      "title": "Antigravity just halved the price of its drone — by swapping its headset for wristwatch control",
      "link": "https://www.theverge.com/tech/1014063/antigravity-a1-drone-follow-me-watch-ring-control",
      "description": "Last year's Antigravity A1 is the best beginner drone I've ever tried. I put a friend who'd never flown into its virtual cockpit and didn't worry one bit. The A1's also nice for people who'd prefer to think about flying rather than filming, because you can reframe its 360-degree footage after. But until today, that [&#8230;]",
